<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51439" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰχθύ-α</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰχθυ-ύη</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰχθῦς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dried skin of the fish</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίνη</span>, like our
				<i>shagreen</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Foet.Exsect.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.406
			</span></i>; of <i>fish-skin</i> in general, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				4.2.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>pot</i>, perh. for pickled fish, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				8345c
			</span></i> (Nola, vase). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>fishing, fishery</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1123.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				3.160.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταριχηρὰ ἰ</span>. pickled <i>fish,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PLond.
				3.856.20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
